    "scenesThatPass": [
      "CAMERON: I feel like this is too much.\nRUTH: If I use less it won’t last.\nCAMERON: The dress is too short.\nRUTH: You just need to get used to it.",
      "CAMERON: Hey.\nCAMERON: I know I look stupid.\nCOLEY: No, it’s nice.\nCOLEY: The makeup looks great. Did you do the makeup, Ruth?",
      "CAMERON: Let’s do the rest later.\nCOLEY: I want a hit.\nBRETT CAMERON: Really? Since when do you smoke?\nCOLEY: It’s a special occasion.",
      "COLEY: I never realized- I never breathe fully. Like, there’s so much more lung room to breathe in than I give myself. Try breathing from your diap…\nCAMERON: Ok, I think you’re good. Let’s go.\nCOLEY: Wait! I have things!",
      "RUTH: I’m so proud of you, honey. Be safe and have a magical night, okay?\nCAMERON: You know those stars are made of cardboard, right?\nRUTH: Okay, Ms. Comedian. I’ll see you at home."
    ]
